<description>&lt;p&gt;Myanmar’s military announced it will not comply with parts of the International Court of Justice genocide ruling, calling them inappropriate. Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the ruling. The U.K. has imposed sanctions on five senior Myanmar military officials. The son of the imprisoned former leader publicly questioned the junta’s motives. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c61wr87wyg5wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQSUtfcFZpNm5zMEVRZi1ScC0yV3VIa0dyMm10YmtnUkYyaWtkd0dVUTRaenM0dGtZTVBfMHJBSlhVUFgybWxxdmpfTDltWXlRZUgyOVVKeW02eGg1bUdqelVQV21ISXhCVktzZlpyX3VSQmNUWjRWbWZYNmdjQUpHMDc2SFdwQU91TW9SVFBxY0ZoSXA1X2RzaXZvN0c4V3l6d1duQzF3UGdQamVZRFVhN25fMV84RDdjREE3SEVGcnFPZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxONElCRnR3VjZCN0JzT1FGVXpSTjVwZXhlTG9wbmpRRDdJNW8wazlPODc2dmQ5YWJBbk5VWElIczRaT2pMbm8wMWNnV1A3MEdIX0ZodENMWl9mMUs3T0xQaEJWVF91YjZhTUZub1U5dFUyRWZTVDFOVDFVRF9VSDJiaTBRZTFDbFl2bUxqNmNrLXpOX1ctY1V3TG9jSG82SjBSRElPOEJyN1BnUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPNmpLZUx2TF81aXIxRTRRekpQNGZ2cGNTMDFpdkVfa2Nad3RwZU1kcUtOOWk1SVVDXy1Sbm1PUVl0Rlg5Z0xHREJ6ZFJ6aU9LMTJoSi1heUVGZC1QLTJKZm12d24xbEZQRE16NGdPOEdSdzU3LXhnSUQ3blRJX3JGMTVXU0xINXNmTjhCMWxCY1pkT1cxYkc2UFhrV2EwbENlamRlSGdVbEdqWnE0YjBVbGR3U09kQUx5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNejJfVmF4cldMSmxMajNlcGFVcWc3Tmp0NHlfUWEzQmtTRkhGOG94YmhycnMwODFXaGZ0R0IwX3JoeWNiSi1UaHFHYnZ